<title>ESTONIA: HANSA LIISING ISSUES 75 MLN IN CPS.</title>
<headline>HANSA LIISING ISSUES 75 MLN IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Liising, the leasing arm of Hansapank , will issue 75 million kroons in one-month commercial papers on Tuesday, Hansapank said.</p>
<p>The commercial papers yield 6.5 percent, the bank's interest rate products manager, Ulo Kallas, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
